      <slide id="experiment-tasks">
        <title>Two Tasks Tackled Two Ways</title>
        <blockquote>
          <p>Task 1: Find the first issue ever opened in cli/cli, not counting pull requests. Who wrote the first comment on it, and when was that person's GitHub account created?</p>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote>
          <p>Task 2: Take the first five issues ever opened in cli/cli, not counting pull requests. For each, count the comments from before 2020 that were written by someone other than the author of the issue. Which issue has the most, and how many?</p>
        </blockquote>
        <p>Using <a href="https://github.com/github/rest-api-description">651 generated tools</a>, or <a href="https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server">GitHub's own 26 MCP tools</a></p>
